platforms/web/dist/
# wasm-pack output for the standalone web demo (not consumed by the
# Flutter package), generated by build scripts — not committed
platforms/web/pkg/
# Flutter web WASM bundle (ratex_wasm.js, ratex_wasm_bg.wasm) is
# committed so `flutter pub get` + `flutter test` work in fresh
# checkouts without needing the Rust toolchain. Re-build with
# `wasm-pack build crates/ratex-wasm --target web
#  --out-dir ../../platforms/flutter/web/pkg --out-name ratex_wasm`
# from the ratex_flutter repo root.
